# Dev-only overrides — loaded by Vite when `mode === 'development'`.
# `.env` keeps the production base URL because it is the value baked into
# `pnpm build`. In dev, requests to the API go through the proxy defined in
# vite.config.ts, which strips the cross-origin and the corporate-firewall
# blocks. See ADR 0005 for the contract and R17 for the cache/CORS rationale.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/pokeapi
VITE_PUBLIC_PATH=